## Data Flow

```
User creates record via Cataloging
       │
       ▼
create_bibliographic_record()
       │
       ├── pop cover_url from db_data (Google Books artefact, not a model field)
       │
       ├── if isbn: _download_cover(isbn)
       │       │
       │       ├── check data/covers/{isbn}.jpg (cache hit → return filename)
       │       │
       │       └── GET covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/{isbn}-M.jpg?default=false
       │               ├── 200 → write to data/covers/{isbn}.jpg → return filename
       │               └── 404 / error → return None (silent, no cover stored)
       │
       └── set cover_image = filename on record → commit
                │
                ▼
         BiblographicRecord.cover_image = "2211056466.jpg"
                │
                ▼
         API response includes cover_image field
                │
                ▼
         Web UI: /covers/2211056466.jpg (StaticFiles mount)
```

