## Coverage Notes

- ~28% of records in the imported catalog (CSV with 2 282 ISBNs) have a cover on Open Library
- ~60% of recently-created records (newer ISBN-13 titles) have a cover
- Records without a cover display the existing book icon — no regression, no user-visible change
- The cover download is a best-effort network call; failure is logged and silently skipped
- ISSNs stored in the ISBN column (periodicals) correctly return 404 and are skipped

